#
#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
msgid ""
"OpenSSL is a cryptography toolkit implementing the Secure Sockets Layer "
"(\\s-1SSL\\s0 v2/v3) and Transport Layer Security (\\s-1TLS\\s0 v1) network "
"protocols and related cryptography standards required by them."
